[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":98},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:11":3},{"posts":4,"total":89,"tags":90,"tag":-1},[5,14,23,31,39,48,56,64,72,81],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"JavaScript 陣列處理方法 [filter(), find(), forEach(), map(), every(), some(), reduce()]","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-01-javascript-for","2017\u002F09\u002F01","2017-09-01","陣列處理技巧是 JavaScript 中非常重要的一塊，現在框架大亂鬥的時代，框架基本上對於 DOM 的處理都有屬於自己一套良好的方法。只要能夠對於陣列資料操作熟悉，配合框架就能夠將開發效率更上層樓。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2FArray_method.png?alt=media&token=787a891f-345c-4927-98b0-70ff34a2a73b",[13],"javascript",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"Bootstrap 4 繁體中文手冊","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-08-13-bootstrap4-zh-tw","2017\u002F08\u002F13","2017-08-13","Bootstrap 是目前最主流的 CSS 框架，由於他包含了大量的元件以及具有良好的架構，在實際運用及擴增也都是非常容易，如今第四版 Beta (Bootstrap 4 Beta) 也釋出，我們先來看看他有什麼樣的改變吧！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F08%2Fbootstrap4.png?alt=media&token=0b014ac6-b99b-46e7-8336-3fbfda1da3c2",[22],"event",{"title":24,"link":25,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":29,"tags":30},"從 CSS 到 Sass 教學，沒對齊就不對勁","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-08-07-aug-css","2017\u002F08\u002F07","2017-08-07","在實戰過程中我們常常會使用一些黑魔法來解決版面的問題，但程式碼是寫給其他人看的 (包含未來的自己)，在經常使用黑魔法的情況下總有一天可能會造成失控！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F08%2FAug_cover.png?alt=media&token=c069db67-eeb4-48fc-a6aa-1ffc459f585f",[22],{"title":32,"link":33,"date":34,"dateTime":35,"description":36,"thumbnail":37,"tags":38},"免費 20 小時網頁設計教學線上試聽","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-07-22-free-demo","2017\u002F07\u002F22","2017-07-22","喜歡我們的課程試聽也歡迎分享你的朋友，若你\u002F妳看完後對我們的課程與服務有興趣，也歡迎你\u002F妳加入六角學院 (\u002F\u002Fwww.hexschool.com\u002F)的大家庭哦 ^_^","https: